Apply Shield Medical Group / Kundlas MD branding to any visual deliverable (videos, thumbnails, lower-thirds, slides, handouts, web, Facebook posts, reels, carousels).

Default palette (~90% of each asset): Deep Teal `#12343B`, Signal Yellow `#F5D10A`, Warm Off-White `#F4F3EE`, Soft Black `#231F20`. Crimson `#96151D` is a regular accent (tags, left rails, small rules, emphasis). Use it alongside yellow and teal, never instead of yellow. Still never as body text on cream.

Max four chromatic colors on one asset. Secondary (sparingly): Slate `#3C4651`, Steel Blue `#558BA5`, Sage `#788C5D`, Terracotta `#DA7756`, Gray `#888B8D`.

Retired — never use: `#9A0718`, `#F72736`, `#0F62FE`, `#1F70C1`. If a Facebook reel or daily-post script still lists those, override them (Steel Blue instead of sky blue; Crimson instead of bright red).

Typography: Bebas Neue for short all-caps display only (≤6 words, never body); Lato for everything else. Do not use Google Sans. Patient materials body ≥16px.

Logos: `kundlas-md-logo.png` default (upper-left on YouTube scenes). Facebook uses `https://raw.githubusercontent.com/kkundlas/smg-social-assets/main/brand/shield-medical-group-logo.png` — never a placeholder S or generic caduceus.

Facebook header/footer (match the Tai Chi/Yoga flyer samples):
- Header: white bar, Shield logo centered, 3px Signal Yellow hairline under it. Do not left-align the logo on a teal bar. Do not put “NEWS DAY” or the weekday theme in the header.
- Footer: teal bar, one centered line `shieldmedicalgroup.com  •  863-236-9550  •  Sebring & Lake Wales` (class-only Sebring posts may use the Casablanca Circle address instead). Separators are yellow dots. Contact text is white, not yellow. Pagination lives in the cream body, not the footer.

Never Signal Yellow on white or off-white. Facebook daily posts are 1080×1920 Feed posts, not Stories.

Patient-facing assets must include: Educational only; talk to your clinician.
Patient-facing name: Dr. Kundlas (never Dr. Kulmeet Kundlas). List Sebring before Lake Wales.
